'''Garma'''<ref name="Fuel for the Fire">{{Resistance|Fuel for the Fire}}</ref> was a [[Gender|female]] [[Arcona]] who lived on the ''[[Colossus]]'' refueling station during the [[New Republic Era|era]] of the [[New Republic]]. She had [[Color|yellow]] [[eye]]s and blue skin.<ref name="The Triple Dark" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Garma was a character developed for the ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' animated series, first appearing in the episode "[[The Triple Dark]]." She was voiced by [[Greg Proops]].<ref name="Fuel for the Fire" /> In the script and an early cut of the [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|season one]] finale "[[No Escape: Part 2]]," Garma was to encounter [[Kazuda Xiono]] in a doorway during a corridor-flooding sequence, pinching his cheek and calling him "an adventurous one" after Xiono tackled her to get her out of the way of the crashing waves.<ref name="No Escape: Part 2">{{SW|url=news/buckets-list-extra-no-escape-part-2-star-wars-resistance|text=Bucket's List Extra: 7 Fun Facts from "No Escape: Part 2" - ''Star Wars Resistance''}}</ref>

